---
# ext-scarpe, ledger N1: Scarpe draws its own controls, so it tells a screen reader what they are.
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: N1
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @bar = progress fraction: 0.4
end
----------- test code
node = a11y_nodes.find { |n| n[:role] == "progress_indicator" }
assert_equal({ value: 0.4, min: 0.0, max: 1.0 }, node[:numeric])
